{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1311.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"e1656fb40ee5ed4d79bb2485a700e05ae0b75d38f25f0bcc7a61c2048e5d8598","ja":"お姉さんの気持ち","zh":"姐姐的心情","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1311.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"5f9054122131adcb320f2ac7865243b118f8f8df6433bce4fa466b2ef2b59018","ja":"馬場さん、貴音さん、\nおふたりには妹がいましたよね？","zh":"马场小姐、贵音小姐，\n两位都有妹妹对吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1311.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"cb25ad9f6982bf50d4fba005515b2dde1189e1418a59eb4de14b7f6c3fe3a7fa","ja":"はい。長らく会えてはいませんが……。\nそれが、どうかしましたか？","zh":"是的。虽然已经好久没见过了……\n请问，有什么事吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1311.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"629aa379b330f8d9a33ed3d158de90e5819c6521ab4f493b33fd9fe0b4187d45","ja":"実はこの前の撮影の時、周防さんと中谷さんのような\n妹がいたらと思いまして……楽しそうだな。","zh":"其实在之前拍摄的时候，我就在想要是能有像\n周防小姐和中谷小姐这样的妹妹就好了……感觉会很开心呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1311.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"25ed363b8229a69cf5863f204830347046f06eb143b5eccc3fa3742aabbd373b","ja":"そうね、あのふたりみたいな妹、私も欲しいわ。\nでも、実際に妹がいると大変なこともあるのよ。","zh":"也是呢，我也想要那两个人那样的妹妹啊。\n不过，真有妹妹的话也会有辛苦的地方哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1311.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"9f49bc59c55cd769baada5a444df4b024c83de135576ee3d9aa6921ee3af9cab","ja":"そうなのですか？　私は一人っ子なので、\n分からないのですが……気になるぞ。","zh":"是这样吗？我是独生女所以不太清楚，\n不过……很好奇呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1311.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"036524099e6094a374798d1d4026f0185d146b95542bdaabe473fa3c247ae8bd","ja":"それなら、瑞希ちゃんに\nお姉ちゃんの大変さを教えてあげないといけないわね。","zh":"既然这样，那我就必须让瑞希\n体会一下当姐姐的辛苦了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1311.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"743b656c77ab8f6c63bd44e73ed73c8bb0b7a2ea21a63426c4c6c0ac539cfad6","ja":"決めたわ！　瑞希ちゃん、\n今日1日、私が瑞希ちゃんの妹よ！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1311.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"2fc6d3e057d5042ee9da07caf6946aefa2537c41ebc5aa0ff403d35ca7847dfc","ja":"ふふっ、面白そうな試みかと。\nそれならば、私も協力いたしましょう。","zh":"呵呵，听起来是个很有趣的尝试。\n既然如此，我也来助一臂之力吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1311.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"167048d9f75880ec19346e004e6bf4a85a558f3818aac9bb0e89a05e7c5e43f5","ja":"ありがとう！　それじゃあ……、\n瑞希お姉ちゃん、覚悟はいいかしら？","zh":"谢谢！那么……\n瑞希姐姐，做好觉悟了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1311.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"9443611fa37a560f3b279d8a28d4620876cd513d06960e0cff7637701cc85622","ja":"わ、わかりました。\n今日1日、おふたりは私の妹です……ドキドキ。","zh":"我、我知道了。\n今天1天，两位就是我的妹妹了……好紧张。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1311.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"55ab89894d29a6a6f3fea2c2c17854ba0b019113fb282d406c75dc046b34ad24","ja":"それじゃあ、早速だけど……瑞希お姉ちゃん、\n私の本読みに付き合って！","zh":"那么事不宜迟……瑞希姐姐，\n陪我对一下台词吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1311.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"96a4aa76e67248eab840ef1a1b5e604bcd7cdde619c2698bb91589b66eb68821","ja":"このみ、お姉様のひとりじめはずるいです。\n私は瑞希お姉様と食事へ行きたいです。","zh":"木美，独占姐姐太狡猾了。\n我也想和瑞希姐姐一起去吃饭。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1311.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"b8c9993b61ad7c07ceaf30168f88c6702348508c126fe294efb1b6f56e36fd4d","ja":"ふたりの妹におねだりされるなんて……ピンチだぞ、\n瑞希。でもやっぱり、とても楽しいです♪","zh":"被两个妹妹撒娇恳求……情况危急啊，\n瑞希。不过果然，还是非常开心呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
